	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r22_poke5_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ぐるるおおーっ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-18T11:43:42" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-18T11:42:46" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ぐるるおおーっ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-18T11:43:42" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-18T11:42:46" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>ポケモン
・c14ジムバッジ取得で出現
・GRIDX＝726、GRIDZ＝138、右向き
・あわせて鳴き声再生
・その後、戦闘へ
</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-08T06:40:12" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>POKE5
ポケモン・テラキオン</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-18T11:44:21" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>A</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-06T09:03:33" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData />
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r22_poke5_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>テラキオンは　どうろの　さきへ
はしりさって　しまった……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-27T05:03:12" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-18T11:43:50" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>テラキオンは　道路の　先へ
走り去ってしまった……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-27T05:03:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-18T11:43:50" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>ポケモン
・戦闘後
・倒した場合のメッセージ
・殿堂入り後に再配置</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-27T03:23:11" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>POKE5
ポケモン・テラキオン</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-18T11:44:23" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-06T09:03:36" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r22_swboss_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>いま　あなたの　めのまえで
そんざいかんを　はなつ▽
その　ポケモンは　テラキオン！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-12T02:31:47" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-20T07:16:40" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>いま　あなたの　眼前で
存在感を　放つ▽
その　ポケモンは　テラキオン！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-12T02:31:45" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-20T07:16:44" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・posでメッセージだけ表示
・続けてswboss_08</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-06T09:13:58" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWBOSS
アクロマ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-20T07:15:59" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>A</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-06T09:03:33" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ffff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r22_swboss_08"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>アクロマ『ひさしぶり　です！▼
テラキオンは
たたかいの　ほのおから　ポケモンを▽
まもるため　ひとと　たたかった▽
３びきの　ポケモンの　いっぴき！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-06T09:13:11" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-06T09:12:36" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>アクロマ『ひさしぶり　です！▼
テラキオンは
戦いの　炎から　ポケモンを▽
守るため　人と　戦った▽
３匹の　ポケモンの　１匹！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-06T09:13:20" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-06T09:12:36" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・アクロマ登場してメッセージ表示
・続けてswboss_02</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-06T09:14:12" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWBOSS
アクロマ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-06T09:13:31" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>A</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-06T09:13:31" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ffff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r22_swboss_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>プラズマだんが　はっする
きけんな　においを　かぎとり▼
かれらに　たいこう　できる
つよき　ポケモントレーナーを▽
もとめて　いるのでしょう！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-17T02:23:39" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-20T07:16:49" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>プラズマ団が　発する
危険な　においを　かぎとり▼
彼らに　対抗できる
強き　ポケモントレーナーを▽
求めて　いるのでしょう！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-17T02:23:42" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-20T07:16:49" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・画面下を向いてメッセージ表示
・続けてswboss_03</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-17T02:23:54" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWBOSS
アクロマ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-20T07:16:49" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>A</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-06T09:03:33" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ffff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r22_swboss_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あなたの　まえに　あらわれたのは
きょうみぶかい　できごと……！▼
それはさておき　あなたは！
プラズマだんと　たたかうのですか？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-21T03:51:41" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-20T07:16:49" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あなたの　前に　現われたのは
興味深い　できごと……！▼
それはさておき　あなたは！
プラズマ団と　戦うのですか？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-21T03:51:58" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-20T07:16:49" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・はい/いいえの選択肢表示
　はい　→swboss_04
　いいえ→swboss_05</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-20T08:56:13" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWBOSS
アクロマ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-20T07:16:49" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>A</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-06T09:03:33" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ffff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r22_swboss_04"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>なるほど！　であるならば！
じぶんの　ポケモンを　まもれる▽
つよさを　もつのです！▼
ポケモンに　まもってもらうだけが
トレーナーでは　ありません！▼
トレーナー　じしんが　つよいからこそ
ポケモンの　ことを　おもうからこそ▽
ポケモンも　ちからを　はっき　できる！▼
よろしい！
これは　わたくしから　です！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-08T06:56:56" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-20T08:53:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>なるほど！　であるならば！
自分の　ポケモンを　守れる▽
強さを　持つのです！▼
ポケモンに　守ってもらうだけが
トレーナーでは　ありません！▼
トレーナー自身が　強いからこそ
ポケモンの　ことを　想うからこそ▽
ポケモンも　力を　発揮できる！▼
よろしい！
これは　わたくしから　です！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-08T06:57:11" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-20T08:53:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・はい選択時
・アイテム入手処理
　No635「アクロママシーン」
・続けてswboss_06</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-17T02:24:23" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWBOSS
アクロマ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-20T08:53:20" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>A</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-06T09:03:33" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ffff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r22_swboss_05"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>なるほど！
それも　ありでしょう！▼
あなたと　あなたの　ポケモンは
すきな　みちを　ゆけば　いいのです！▼
あなたが　すべきことは
ポケモンの　ちからを▼
さいだいげんに　はっきさせるべく
ポケモンの　ことを　おもうこと！▼
よろしい！
これは　わたくしから　です！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-21T03:52:32" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-20T08:53:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>なるほど！
それも　ありでしょう！▼
あなたと　あなたの　ポケモンは
好きな　道を　行けば　いいのです！▼
あなたが　すべきことは
ポケモンの　力を▼
最大限に　発揮させるべく
ポケモンの　ことを　想うこと！▼
よろしい！
これは　わたくしから　です！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-21T03:52:48" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-20T08:53:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・いいえ選択時
・アイテム入手処理
　No635「アクロママシーン」
・続けてswboss_06</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-17T02:24:20" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWBOSS
アクロマ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-20T08:53:22" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>A</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-06T09:03:33" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ffff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r22_swboss_06"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>それは！▼
ポケモンを　かっせいか　させる
そうちの　しさくひん！▼
たたかっている
ポケモンには　つかえませんが▽
なにかの　やくに　たつでしょう！▼
では　あなたと　ポケモンの
たびの　ぶじを　いのって！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-08T07:09:44" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-08T05:56:58" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>それは！▼
ポケモンを　活性化させる
装置の　試作品！▼
戦っている
ポケモンには　使えませんが▽
なにかの　役に　立つでしょう！▼
では　あなたと　ポケモンの
旅の　無事を　祈って！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-08T07:10:20" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-08T05:57:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・表示後、c14方向に移動
・！マークをだし、主人公を振り返り
　メッセージ表示
・続けてswboss_07</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-07T13:08:57" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWBOSS
アクロマ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-08T05:58:11" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>A</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-06T09:03:33" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ffff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r22_swboss_07"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>そういえば！▼
２１ばんすいどうに　ある
うみべのどうくつの　なかで▼
４ばんどうろを　おもいだすような
なつかしい　ものを　みましたよ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-22T03:23:46" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-07T13:04:27" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>そういえば！▼
２１番水道に　ある
海辺の洞穴の　中で▼
４番道路を　思いだすような
懐かしい　ものを　みましたよ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-22T03:24:15" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-07T13:08:31" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・表示後、再度c14方向に消えて行く
・画面外に消えると主人公操作可能</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-07T13:04:11" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWBOSS
アクロマ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-07T13:03:28" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
